          "Who is the person in your organization with the most potential who is most in need of deliberate development? What commitment are you making to that person this week?",
          "When you imagine the organization you are building at its best -- not in five years, but in twenty -- who is leading it, what does it stand for, and what has it accomplished that you are most proud of?",
